WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.940 --> 00:00:17.619
Emmy was doing her homework.

2
00:00:17.620 --> 00:00:22.738
"I have to do a science experiment," she said.

3
00:00:22.739 --> 00:00:28.036
"Make a volcano, Emmy!" Oliver said.

4
00:00:28.037 --> 00:00:32.637
"Volcanoes are boring," Emmy said.

5
00:00:32.638 --> 00:00:37.376
"They're just vinegar and baking soda."

6
00:00:37.377 --> 00:00:41.296
"You could put something else in the volcano," Harry said.

7
00:00:41.297 --> 00:00:44.192
"Like what?" asked Emmy.

8
00:00:44.193 --> 00:00:49.339
"Some kids use ketchup instead of vinegar," Harry said.

9
00:00:49.340 --> 00:00:53.019
"That makes red lava!"

10
00:00:53.020 --> 00:00:57.307
"Cool!" said Emmy.

11
00:00:57.308 --> 00:00:59.846
Aunt Judy looked worried.

12
00:00:59.847 --> 00:01:04.386
"Will it make a mess?" she asked.

13
00:01:04.387 --> 00:01:07.624
"Mom might get mad."

14
00:01:07.625 --> 00:01:11.961
"Mom won't mind!" said Emmy.

15
00:01:11.962 --> 00:01:27.897
"Mom loves science experiments!" said Oliver.

16
00:01:27.898 --> 00:01:33.403
Emmy made a clay mountain.

17
00:01:33.404 --> 00:01:37.013
She made a hole in the top.

18
00:01:37.014 --> 00:01:43.320
Then she mixed ketchup with some soap and water.

19
00:01:43.321 --> 00:01:47.426
Emmy poured the mixture into the volcano.

20
00:01:47.427 --> 00:01:52.723
"Let's put some glitter in too!" she said.

21
00:01:52.724 --> 00:01:58.732
Finally she added baking soda.

22
00:01:58.733 --> 00:02:01.808
Everyone waited.

23
00:02:01.809 --> 00:02:04.955
The volcano steamed.

24
00:02:04.956 --> 00:02:08.844
Then it exploded!

25
00:02:08.845 --> 00:02:12.483
Red lava spilled out of the volcano.

26
00:02:12.484 --> 00:02:15.715
It dripped all over the floor.

27
00:02:15.716 --> 00:02:19.889
Glitter sprayed everywhere.

28
00:02:19.890 --> 00:02:23.772
"That was not boring!" Emmy said.

29
00:02:23.773 --> 00:02:27.141
Oliver clapped.

30
00:02:27.142 --> 00:02:34.212
Harry laughed and laughed.

31
00:02:34.213 --> 00:02:38.284
"What's going on?" someone asked.

32
00:02:38.285 --> 00:02:41.438
Everyone looked up.

33
00:02:41.439 --> 00:02:45.235
Mom stood in the doorway.

34
00:02:45.236 --> 00:02:48.332
She was frowning at the mess.

35
00:02:48.333 --> 00:02:58.502
Aunt Judy gulped.

36
00:02:58.503 --> 00:03:06.901
"We were doing a science experiment!" Emmy said.

37
00:03:06.902 --> 00:03:09.741
She grabbed a sponge.

38
00:03:09.742 --> 00:03:20.397
"But now we're cleaning up!"
